set data = '{"instructions": "Directions: Write a paragraph (6–8 sentences) about \"An Unforgettable School Experience\" using at least five different cohesive devices.", "questions": [{"id": "q1", "type": "short_answer", "subjective": true, "prompt": "Write your paragraph here.", "points": 8, "sampleAnswer": "Last year, our class joined a regional quiz bee, and it turned out to be an unforgettable experience. At first, I was nervous because the competition included top schools in the region. However, our team practiced every day after class to prepare. As we studied together, we also became closer as friends. During the competition, we faced difficult questions, but we stayed calm and supported each other. In addition, our coach reminded us to trust our preparation. As a result, we placed among the top three teams. Because of that experience, I learned that teamwork and preparation can help us overcome even the most challenging situations."}]}'::jsonb
